+/**
+ * Contrato (TASK-032 RED ÔåÆ TASK-033 GREEN) ÔÇö plan.md "Patch v5" ┬º3
+ * "AsyncState (props)" + "AsyncState (preced├¬ncia fixa ÔÇö D19)" e spec.md Patch v5
